{"type":"text","id":"pb3","x":1042,"y":706,"width":400,"height":150,"text":"• 树化：链表长度 > 8\n  且 数组长度 ≥ 64\n• 表长 < 64 时优先扩容，\n  而非树化\n• 退化：树节点 ≤ 6 → 链表","originalText":"• 树化：链表长度 > 8\n  且 数组长度 ≥ 64\n• 表长 < 64 时优先扩容，\n  而非树化\n• 退化：树节点 ≤ 6 → 链表","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":6311,"version":1,"versionNonce":6311,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.6},
