{"type":"text","id":"pb4","x":1522,"y":706,"width":420,"height":150,"text":"• 1.7 数组 + 链表，头插法\n  并发扩容迁移 → 死循环\n• 1.8 数组 + 链表 + 红黑树\n  尾插法，避免死循环\n• 线程安全 → ConcurrentHashMap","originalText":"• 1.7 数组 + 链表，头插法\n  并发扩容迁移 → 死循环\n• 1.8 数组 + 链表 + 红黑树\n  尾插法，避免死循环\n• 线程安全 → ConcurrentHashMap","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":6314,"version":1,"versionNonce":6314,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.6}
